{"id":"n22874-2-5","stage":5,"title":"갑 · 甲","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22874-2-5-1","ko":"이번 선거의 강남 갑 후보로 나온 사람은 몇 명이랍니까?","zh":"这次选举中作为江南甲选区的候选人出选的有几个人呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"선거의","meaning":"选举","explanation":"선거：选举；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"선거","audio":"/audio/c091c2a2a2efa68e985a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16617","senseId":"1","lemma":"선거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선거의","audio":"/audio/8a57452b30d42eb109e3.mp3"}},{"text":"강남","meaning":"江南","explanation":"강남：江南","readings":[{"term":"강남","audio":"/audio/44adfa5ab3141b5752a9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강남","audio":"/audio/44adfa5ab3141b5752a9.mp3"}},{"text":"갑","meaning":"甲，甲级","explanation":"갑：甲，甲级","readings":[{"term":"갑","audio":"/audio/fbf800b50240d9944b16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22874","senseId":"2","lemma":"갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑","audio":"/audio/fbf800b50240d9944b16.mp3"}},{"text":"후보로","meaning":"候选人","explanation":"후보：候选人；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"후보","audio":"/audio/7baf75f51c9d0d7daeae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88102","senseId":"1","lemma":"후보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후보로","audio":"/audio/13fbfab58b16f59fda04.mp3"}},{"text":"나온","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나온","audio":"/audio/a357a