":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]}],"audio":"/audio/9d589462761d8fd17655.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22874-2-5-2","ko":"이번엔 다섯 명이라고 하더라고요.","zh":"听说这次有五个人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번엔","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번엔","audio":"/audio/eae819c16fe222c8b75e.mp3"}},{"text":"다섯","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}},{"text":"명이라고","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명이라고","audio":"/audio/684e25e0309b33454d85.mp3"}},{"text":"하더라고요.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하더라고요","audio":"/audio/f483bb8851b5e6271dbf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"0d61